The Get Smart costs more and does more. Prices are R$ 79,90/month for the Get Clássica and R$ 129,90/month for the Get Smart [prod-todas-as-maquininhas-04][prod-get-tap-03].

**Get Smart:** It's a smart machine that works as both the computer and the fiscal printer. On the device you can:
- control stock;
- take orders and close tabs;
- load a menu;
- issue invoices and fiscal receipts.

It also reconciles payments in every method: credit, debit, store credit, QR Code and cash [sup-duvidas-get-smart-10][sup-duvidas-get-smart-08].

**Get Clássica:** The sources I found don't describe its features, so I can't compare the two beyond price. I can pass your question to a human agent for the details.
